  "question": {
    "text": "$\\vec{a}, \\vec{b}, \\vec{c}$ are non-coplanar vectors and $\\lambda$ is a real number then the vectors $\\vec{a}+2 \\vec{b}+3 \\vec{c}, \\lambda \\vec{b}+4 \\vec{c}$ and $(2 \\lambda-1) \\vec{c}$ are non-coplanar for",
